---
// FactoryStrength.astro - 金属包装/易开盖工厂实力板块
---

<section class="py-20 bg-slate-900 text-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- 标题部分 -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-blue-400 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Factory Strength</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold mt-2">End-to-End Manufacturing You Can Audit and Trust</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-4 text-base">
        From precision tooling to high-speed container shipment, our vertically integrated facility gives overseas buyers transparent capacity, consistent quality, and reliable lead times.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 四大核心实力卡片 -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      
      <!-- 卡片 1：模具与研发 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/50 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="text-sm text-blue-400 font-semibold mb-1">15+ Years Experience</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">In-House Tooling & R&D</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Specialized in fast mold design, contour optimization, and precision tooling for various easy-open end sizes (e.g., 200, 202, 206) to match unique client specifications.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 卡片 2：生产车间与设备 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/50 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="text-sm text-blue-400 font-semibold mb-1">Advanced Automated Presses</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">High-Speed Stamping Lines</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Equipped with high-speed automatic press lines, precision scroll cutting, and automated coating workshops ensuring stable, continuous large-scale production.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 卡片 3：质量检测 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/50 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="text-sm text-blue-400 font-semibold mb-1">100% Online Inspection</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Rigorous Quality Control</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Multi-stage QC including tinplate/aluminum thickness check, rivet integrity test, and full online video inspection to guarantee zero-leakage standards.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 卡片 4：产能与供应链 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/50 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="text-sm text-blue-400 font-semibold mb-1">Millions of Ends / Month</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Mass Production Capacity</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Massive monthly output with scalable manufacturing lines, flexible MOQ, and reliable global shipping to support both seasonal peaks and long-term contracts.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>